# Battle for Sem Valor -- BUILD folder (the copy people download and play).
# Tracked: only what the game needs to run:
#   Battle for Sem Valor.exe, Battle for Sem Valor_Data/, MonoBleedingEdge/, D3D12/,
#   UnityPlayer.dll, UnityCrashHandler64.exe, WinPixEventRuntime.dll
# Everything below is left out.

# Debug information Unity writes next to a build. Never needed to play.
*_BurstDebugInformation_DoNotShip/
*_BackUpThisFolder_ButDontShipItWithYourGame/
*.pdb

# Zipped copies of the build (large, and out of date the moment the build changes)
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar

# Unity editor plugins that ended up here. Not part of the game.
/Packages/

# Logs and crash dumps
*.log
*.dmp
Crashes/
sysinfo.txt

# Windows and editor clutter
Thumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
.vs/
*.tmp
